  message: "Fixed in PR #2810. Set ry.width = sys.maxsize in store.py:_serialize_op so ruamel.yaml never folds long scalars; per-line nonce post-processor can no longer inject # comments mid-string. Added TestLongStringRoundtrip class with 7 regression tests covering 5KB description, 5KB field value, 10KB no-spaces scalar, adversarial literal '# NNNN' patterns, INV-gajap size class, fold-boundary canary, and observable-property width guard."  # 8af3
